docs/lab.ko.md says when to use each.

  ./lab up [PROJECT_ID]        build the whole lab; run it again to put back the code's settings
                               (no ID: the project Cloud Shell shows, after you confirm it)
  ./lab iam                    who may do what, by service account
  ./lab event ID [--opens-in MINUTES] [--seats N] [--waitlist N] [--title TEXT]   create a published event
  ./lab load EVENT_ID [--users N] [--minutes M]   load test: visitors rush the event's opening
  ./lab coldstart              time the first request to web, then five more
