  ./lab mail on|off            turn real email on or off
  ./lab code                   your latest sign-in code, from the logs (while email is off)
  ./lab check [NAME ...]       check what is built (every check without NAME)
  ./lab check --report         every check, saved to ~/lab-report.txt for submission
  ./lab drift                  what differs between the live project and the code
  ./lab pause                  pause the Scheduler, turn off deploys
  ./lab down                   delete everything the lab made in Google Cloud
  one part at a time, as in the hand-built lab:
  ./lab start PROJECT_ID       tools, GitHub sign-in, APIs, image registry
  ./lab base|workers|warmup|deployer   build that part
  ./lab env [web|job|github]   values to paste into the Console and GitHub
  ./lab skip STEP              build a hand step for you; the report shows it as skipped

Everything is built with Terraform parts (infra/lab.tf). A piece already made by hand in
the Console is taken over, not made twice. The lab's settings live in ~/.gdgoc-lab, so
any clone of the repository can use them.
"""

